OL,3,ADolly Parton: The country legend who
OL,4,Asang from the heart
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was also a savvy businesswoman who
OL,7,Fwasn't afraid to make tough decisions.
OL,8,FArmed with a quick wit and southern
OL,9,Fcharm, she took control of her show
OL,10,Fbusiness career that spanned more than
OL,11,F60 years.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/17
